error[Z0802]: no regressor remains: every one is absorbed by fe: unit + year (`event=-2`, `event=0`, `event=1`)
 --> scripts/main.zeff:2:3
  |
2 | d.reg(y ~ event(year, treat), fe: unit + year)
  |   ^^^ nothing varies within the effects' levels
  |
  = help: a regressor must vary within the levels of every effect; the leads and lags of units all treated at once are the time effects themselves, so drop the time effect or add never-treated units
